# CPU end-to-end test of the run-manifest check in lm_eval_lab.py (the question in the Team 9 group, 25 Nov)
# Thu 26 Nov 2026, Windows 11 laptop, CPU only, branch base origin/main 821c82ad (#812). Each command with its
# exit code and wall time.
# Edits to this log: progress bars, torch's single-process checkpoint warning and the 'scoring <task>' lines are left
# out, and RESULT lines are shown for s1 and t1 only. Folders: <scratch> is the test folder, <p1536> the folder of the
# frozen p1536 tokenizer.json (sha256 e6b93a93...25a64b), <hf> the Hugging Face cache, <lab> the laptop lab folder;
# python is the venv (Python 3.12.10, torch 2.14.1+cpu, lm_eval 0.4.13).
